<title>ITALY: Italy's San Paolo cuts prime rate.</title>
<headline>Italy's San Paolo cuts prime rate.</headline>
<dateline>TURIN, Italy 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's San Paolo bank said it was cutting its prime lending rate to 9.0 percent from 9.5 percent as of March 1.</p>
<p>San Paolo said in statement it was also lowering its top or ceiling rate to 15.75 percent from 16 percent. --Milan bureau +392 66129507</p>
</text>
